ect. It is distinct from the Tatsuya Endo collection routed as Shihou Yuugi. This entrypoint is the single first-read surface; the evidence-library folder is a source route, not an analytical authority.\n\n**SEQUENTIAL_ANALYSIS_LOCK = OPEN.** V09 is the committed high-water mark. The next permitted narrative operation is **V10**. Read the [V09 deep reading](readings/SHIBOYUGI_V09_DEEP_READING.md) and [V09 checkpoint](checkpoints/SHIBOYUGI_V09_CHECKPOINT.md) before opening another unit. This run remains bounded to V01–V10.\n\n## Governing route\n\nRead the [method](SHIBOYUGI_ANALYTICAL_METHOD.md) and [architecture](SHIBOYUGI_SYNTHESIS_ARCHITECTURE.md) in full before changing project state. The method governs evidence reading and judgment; the architecture governs accumulation, revision, specialist responsibilities and convergence.\n\n| Initialized home | Present responsibility |\n|---|---|\n| [Source register](SHIBOYUGI_SOURCE_REGISTER.md) | Ten available unit identities, reported audit results, exact achieved verification and unresolved source obligations |\n| [State and evidence ledger](SHIBOYUGI_STATE_AND_EVIDENCE_LEDGER.md) | Cumulative named-subject, directed-relationship, knowledge, disclosure and material-constraint changes, with evidence retrieval |\n| [Claim and forecast ledger](SHIBOYUGI_CLAIM_AND_FORECAST_LEDGER.md) | Full argument retrieval, rival explanations, append-only claim transitions, forecasts and separate adjudications |\n| [Character reconstruction contract](SHIBOYUGI_CHARACTER_RECONSTRUCTION_CONTRACT.md) | Future evidence-to-model pathway, source/temporal bounds, validation and separate acceptance responsibilities |\n\nThe two ledgers preserve the zero-admission baseline and changes through V09. The V09 checkpoint maintains the distinct exposure, chronology, interpretation and test boundaries. Monograph production and reconstruction remain downstream responsibilities.\n\n## Historical source reconnaissance, November 13\n\nA November 13, 2026 me