econstruction acceptance. The reviewer identified the missing November 14 monograph standard and accepted the exact architecture amendment (blob `163ced927738b7d2ef71e6b818f97152c717e3d4`). The source-grounded reviews through V09 retained the INITIAL design and its two ledgers. The V01 checkpoint records improved component classification. The V02 and V03 checkpoints record independent role contributions and frozen tests. The V03 review increased the priority of qualification checks for apprenticeship and relationships. V04 adds ordinary and professional evidence for candidate portraits and an independently originated prospective lane for topics affected by an incidental preview. The V05 checkpoint preserves that independently authored lane, bounds its use to actual exposure, and adds qualification material on apprenticeship, alternate perception and performed identity. V06 strengthens the character and relationship qualification routes through the first-game past and present collaborations. New records preserve competing numerals in the source and separate actor knowledge, staged evidence and witnessed result. V07 adds sighted and nonsighted decision bounds, cross-domain education and distinct cases of private cooperation, family work and group participation. V08 extends rule and institutional knowledge, distinguishes the manager benefit from participation in a succession contest, and records medical and housing accommodations with their actual holders and effects. V09 records the retrospective scope of succession knowledge, split agency and game enforcement, the difference between two consequential defeats and social obligations carried beyond competitive play. Detailed findings and acceptance have separate private receipts.\n\nThe owner's November 15, 2026 Codex instruction and attached prompt authorize SBY-RUN-20261115-V01-V10, one continuous sequential run of V01–V10 of the supplied Japanese main novels with eligible original illustrations, followed by source-bo